WEBVTT

00:00.900 --> 00:01.770
You bastard!

00:01.770 --> 00:03.230
Apologise now, Natsuhi!

00:03.230 --> 00:04.650
Aren't you the one at fault, Maho?

00:04.650 --> 00:06.050
What did you say-

00:10.340 --> 00:11.430
What do you want, Saki?

00:11.430 --> 00:12.700
Don't get in our way.

00:13.150 --> 00:15.200
I'm going back if both of you keep fighting!

00:16.460 --> 00:18.080
We're not fighting...

00:18.080 --> 00:19.080
Right, Natushi?

00:19.080 --> 00:22.230
Yeah, we were just playing around.

00:22.230 --> 00:22.920
Right?

00:22.920 --> 00:25.850
Yes, we were just playing around...

00:38.010 --> 00:41.350
Don't give up and do your best

00:41.350 --> 00:44.730
Try your luck and fight! Chin-up!

00:44.730 --> 00:47.770
I know perfectly

00:47.770 --> 00:51.440
How weak a person is on their own

00:51.650 --> 00:54.610
Things that are on the verge of being lost

00:54.610 --> 00:58.280
I hold them close to my chest

00:58.280 --> 01:01.240
Your gentle words

01:01.240 --> 01:05.210
Caress my cheeks

01:05.210 --> 01:08.250
The irritation that has been building up

01:08.250 --> 01:11.050
From wanting to reach the goal

01:11.050 --> 01:15.220
My heart that almost wants to burst out crying

01:15.220 --> 01:18.800
The place that warms it up

01:18.800 --> 01:21.720
Even if we have to go through the pain

01:21.720 --> 01:25.230
We have to protect this

01:26.690 --> 01:28.600
We won't lose now

01:28.600 --> 01:31.980
We will raise our small hands up in the air

01:31.980 --> 01:35.400
Take in that vital power, embrace it

01:35.400 --> 01:38.860
Then release it towards the sky!

01:38.860 --> 01:40.410
The courage that cannot be stopped

01:40.410 --> 01:42.240
jump and shoot

01:40.410 --> 01:42.240
Tomorrow we'll jump and shoot!

01:42.240 --> 01:45.160
I will pass the ball to you

01:45.160 --> 01:49.460
The memories that are awoken by our calls

01:49.460 --> 01:53.000
Game

01:49.460 --> 01:53.000
Will move the game along

01:59.550 --> 02:02.930
Metal Master

02:03.310 --> 02:05.350
Thanks for the meal!

02:07.140 --> 02:09.940
I'm sorry for always making you wash our dishes.

02:09.940 --> 02:12.230
Well, everyone else made the meal,

02:12.230 --> 02:13.900
so it's the least I can do.

02:13.900 --> 02:16.150
Shall we get Natsuhi to help, too?

02:16.150 --> 02:18.570
He's not doing anything.

02:18.990 --> 02:19.820
It's fine.

02:19.820 --> 02:22.450
I like doing this, anyway.

02:22.450 --> 02:25.450
Um, I'm sorry about yesterday.

02:29.370 --> 02:34.190
You wanted me to help with Natushi and Maho's situation,

02:34.190 --> 02:37.390
yet I was being cold-hearted...

02:39.800 --> 02:42.140
If that's what you're talking about, then you shouldn't worry.

02:42.140 --> 02:43.180
I shouldn't worry?

02:43.180 --> 02:43.930
Yeah.

02:43.930 --> 02:45.470
Probably.

02:48.680 --> 02:49.520
All right!

02:49.520 --> 02:50.770
It's the last lap!

02:52.480 --> 02:53.560
We can do it!

02:53.560 --> 02:55.320
Oh~!

02:57.230 --> 02:58.740
What's that about?

02:58.740 --> 03:00.280
It has nothing to do with us.

03:00.280 --> 03:03.660
He can do as he pleases, even if it's training with us.

03:04.530 --> 03:06.160
That's true.

03:06.160 --> 03:08.620
All right, let's take a break here.

03:10.920 --> 03:14.750
Hasegawa-san, I want to confirm this afternoon's schedule.

03:14.750 --> 03:15.750
Okay.

03:17.840 --> 03:18.960
I got it.

03:18.960 --> 03:20.510
I'll tell everyone.

03:20.510 --> 03:22.300
I'll leave it to you.

03:24.010 --> 03:25.100
What is it?

03:25.100 --> 03:30.020
Natsuhi was willing to train with us because of you, right?

03:30.730 --> 03:34.480
You must've lectured him about lots of stuff yesterday.

03:35.820 --> 03:37.480
Was it that obvious?

03:37.940 --> 03:40.490
I did think that I might be butting in, but...

03:40.490 --> 03:43.160
...in the end, it really wasn't needed.

03:43.160 --> 03:44.490
In reality...

03:46.330 --> 03:47.580
I see.

03:47.580 --> 03:48.870
And because of that, Natsuhi...

03:48.870 --> 03:51.370
Takenaka understood too, I guess.

03:51.370 --> 03:53.370
Maho isn't just playing around.

03:53.370 --> 03:55.850
She's serious about basketball.

03:55.850 --> 03:58.120
They might still have their disagreements,

03:58.120 --> 04:01.260
but I'm satisfied with just convincing him to train with us.

04:01.260 --> 04:03.130
Let's practise our shooting seriously, okay?

04:02.090 --> 04:04.180
Serious about basketball, huh?

04:03.130 --> 04:04.180
Yeah!

04:05.140 --> 04:09.600
Maho's selfishness was the reason I joined the girls' basketball club.

04:10.560 --> 04:11.430
Is this...

04:11.430 --> 04:13.100
They're eyeguards for basketball.

04:13.100 --> 04:14.850
They've been made specially for your vision.

04:14.850 --> 04:16.150
Wait a minute, Maho!

04:16.150 --> 04:17.770
Telling me to play basketball...

04:17.770 --> 04:22.570
I've already made them, so you have to take responsibility and join our club.

04:24.070 --> 04:27.120
I mean, those were custom-made eyeguards.

04:27.120 --> 04:30.240
She did so much that there was no way I could've said no.

04:30.240 --> 04:32.750
So that's how you got those eyeguards.

04:33.790 --> 04:38.420
The way she asked me to join was rather crazy, but her eyes were really serious.

04:38.420 --> 04:40.590
Maho was serious about this from the start.

04:42.920 --> 04:45.790
I started basketball on a sudden note,

04:45.790 --> 04:48.640
but now I'm working really hard!

04:48.640 --> 04:50.470
I know that.

04:50.470 --> 04:54.560
I'm sorry for making you do all the boring work,

04:54.560 --> 04:57.100
like organising and contacting everyone.

04:57.100 --> 04:58.110
It's nothing.

04:58.110 --> 05:03.610
I kind of like supporting everyone from the back.

05:03.610 --> 05:09.410
Also, Hasegawa-san thought I was suitable for this role, right?

05:09.410 --> 05:11.330
Yeah, of course.

05:11.330 --> 05:13.080
That's why I'm happy.

05:16.080 --> 05:18.290
Huh, where are Maho and Saki?

05:18.290 --> 05:20.590
They said it was their turn to clean the gym hall and left.

05:20.590 --> 05:22.340
Did we decide something like that?

05:22.340 --> 05:23.340
Oh~!

05:23.340 --> 05:26.340
Takenaka was supposed to be in
charge too, so they took him along.

05:28.220 --> 05:31.600
Three people is enough to mop the gym before practice, right?

05:31.600 --> 05:33.350
Well, that's true, but...

05:33.350 --> 05:35.180
Why does it have to be us three?

05:35.180 --> 05:36.230
That's right.

05:36.230 --> 05:38.770
Why do we have to clean the hall with someone like Natsuhi?

05:38.770 --> 05:40.940
What do you mean, "someone like me"?

05:40.940 --> 05:42.860
That's exactly what I mean!

05:42.860 --> 05:44.740
Well, it's all good, isn't it?

05:44.740 --> 05:46.860
We're childhood friends, anyway.

05:46.860 --> 05:49.450
That has nothing to do with cleaning.

05:49.450 --> 05:52.490
Look, if we continue slacking like this, everyone's going to come back.

05:52.490 --> 05:54.160
Yeah, yeah.

05:54.160 --> 05:56.660
Geez, what a pain.

06:00.080 --> 06:02.880
It's still a bit early, but let's start practising!

06:02.880 --> 06:04.590
How about just some light exercises?

06:04.590 --> 06:06.130
Let's do this.

06:06.130 --> 06:09.640
Even though this is a training camp,
there's very little actual training going on.

06:09.640 --> 06:11.550
That guy's always been a slacker.

06:11.930 --> 06:13.890
Don't say anything bad about Subarun!

06:13.890 --> 06:15.140
But...

06:17.480 --> 06:19.900
I don't think he's such a bad guy.

06:21.610 --> 06:23.070
Of course!

06:25.150 --> 06:27.570
Hasegawa-san told me what happened.

06:27.570 --> 06:29.410
What do you mean?

06:29.410 --> 06:30.990
What happened yesterday night...

06:30.990 --> 06:32.490
That chat with him...

06:32.490 --> 06:35.120
Don't you have something to say to Maho?

06:35.740 --> 06:37.790
If so, I think you have a chance right now.

06:37.790 --> 06:39.420
No one else is here.

06:40.670 --> 06:41.830
Nice shot!

06:53.800 --> 06:55.060
What is it?

07:02.650 --> 07:04.400
Sorry.

07:04.400 --> 07:06.320
I'm sorry for getting angry with you.

07:08.650 --> 07:11.410
I was wrong about you.

07:13.740 --> 07:15.240
Stop it!

07:15.240 --> 07:18.040
That feels so weird!

07:18.040 --> 07:19.120
Here!

07:25.000 --> 07:27.170
Hold it right there, Natushi!

07:28.340 --> 07:31.220
What was that, all of a sudden?

07:29.920 --> 07:31.220
Oh~!

07:31.220 --> 07:33.180
Maho and Takenaka-kun are...

07:33.180 --> 07:35.140
...practising together.

07:36.390 --> 07:37.930
Did they make up?

07:37.930 --> 07:40.310
Who knows?

07:40.310 --> 07:42.350
Seems like it's all settled.

07:43.900 --> 07:48.190
Even if I beat you now, it means nothing because that's just predictable.

07:48.190 --> 07:49.880
If you want to settle things through basketball,

07:49.880 --> 07:51.790
improve first, and then we'll talk.

07:51.790 --> 07:53.410
What did you say?!

07:52.320 --> 07:54.490
"Improve", he says.

07:53.410 --> 07:56.030
Being all arrogant again...!

07:56.030 --> 07:57.790
Go for it, Maho!

07:58.700 --> 08:00.500
Maho!

07:58.700 --> 07:59.830
That's good!

07:59.830 --> 08:00.830
Go for it!

08:00.500 --> 08:02.580
Keep it up!

08:00.830 --> 08:01.830
Subarun...

08:01.830 --> 08:03.120
Everyone...

08:06.000 --> 08:08.130
All right!

08:08.130 --> 08:10.420
All right, everyone, let's practise too!

08:10.420 --> 08:12.340
Yes!

08:13.220 --> 08:15.180
You're as dependable as always, Saki.

08:15.180 --> 08:17.390
No, that's not true.

08:17.390 --> 08:20.270
It's just because I've been with those two for a very long time.

08:30.030 --> 08:31.990
We'll end today's practice session here!

08:32.570 --> 08:35.450
Airi, you and I are supposed to go buy ingredients, right?

08:35.450 --> 08:36.280
Yup.

08:36.280 --> 08:39.330
Then, we'll go off to buy the ingredients for dinner.

08:39.330 --> 08:40.200
Don't worry.

08:40.200 --> 08:43.330
I bought the ingredients last night.

08:43.330 --> 08:44.370
Ingredients?

08:44.750 --> 08:46.790
I was thinking about making okonomiyaki today.

08:47.580 --> 08:49.460
Okonomiyaki?!

08:49.460 --> 08:53.050
Huh, none of you like okonomiyaki?

08:53.050 --> 08:55.430
No, that's not it.

08:56.640 --> 08:57.430
Who did this?

08:57.430 --> 08:59.350
Who cut this yam?

08:59.930 --> 09:01.220
It was me...

09:01.220 --> 09:04.810
Hey you, why did you use such a coarse grater?!

09:04.810 --> 09:07.770
There's no point putting in yams unless they're small!

09:08.150 --> 09:09.770
You're making this again.

09:09.770 --> 09:11.020
Never mind!

09:11.020 --> 09:11.980
I'll do it myself.

09:11.980 --> 09:14.780
You shouldn't cut the cabbage into long pieces like that.

09:14.780 --> 09:15.950
Cut them into short pieces!

09:15.950 --> 09:17.070
Yes!

09:17.070 --> 09:18.410
Wait a moment, Natsuhi!

09:18.410 --> 09:20.950
What are you trying to do there?!

09:20.950 --> 09:22.540
I was going to put the flour into the pan...

09:22.540 --> 09:24.040
Don't do anything that's unnecessary.

09:24.040 --> 09:27.080
If you put it in while it's still hot, it's all going to go to waste!

09:27.080 --> 09:28.460
I'm sorry!

09:29.500 --> 09:31.000
Everyone, it's okay!

09:31.000 --> 09:33.130
I'll take care of the rest myself!

09:33.130 --> 09:35.840
What in the world happened to Saki?

09:35.840 --> 09:39.780
Saki's father owns an okonomiyaki shop,

09:39.780 --> 09:42.640
and she helps out a lot at the store.

09:42.640 --> 09:47.770
And because of that, she's really
obsessed with yakisoba and okonomiyaki.

09:48.770 --> 09:51.190
It's a surprising side to her, I guess.

09:53.780 --> 09:54.650
Did you find her?

09:54.650 --> 09:56.740
No, not here.

09:56.740 --> 10:00.870
When I was going to ask Takenaka-kun for help, I couldn't find him.

10:00.870 --> 10:02.120
Natsuhi, too?

10:02.120 --> 10:03.540
So, are they together?

10:03.540 --> 10:04.750
I don't know.

10:04.750 --> 10:07.330
It's already really dark, so let's go back.

10:07.330 --> 10:08.960
Let's do that.

10:08.960 --> 10:12.380
It'd be bad if Maho wet her pants because she's scared of the dark.

10:12.380 --> 10:13.920
I wouldn't do something like that!

10:13.920 --> 10:16.800
I wonder where Hina-chan went...

10:17.510 --> 10:19.220
They disappeared?

10:19.220 --> 10:19.970
Yes.

10:19.970 --> 10:21.470
Right after dinner...

10:21.470 --> 10:22.890
...Hina disappeared.

10:22.890 --> 10:25.140
We split up and searched for them, but...

10:25.140 --> 10:29.810
Natushi must have been unable to resist his feelings for Hina and boldly kidnapped her!

10:29.810 --> 10:30.770
That's not possible.

10:30.770 --> 10:32.860
Are there any places you haven't searched?

10:32.860 --> 10:35.730
We've searched most of the school.

10:36.490 --> 10:38.530
Could they be at the village shrine?

10:38.530 --> 10:39.360
Shrine?

10:39.740 --> 10:43.160
There's a basketball hoop there that Natsuhi made.

10:45.160 --> 10:46.910
It's pitch black.

10:48.290 --> 10:53.290
Takenaka should be fine, but did
Hinata-chan really go through here?

10:53.290 --> 10:55.550
She didn't go through here.

10:55.550 --> 10:59.130
It'd be better to find them somewhere else.

10:59.130 --> 11:01.550
That's why I asked you if you wanted to stay behind and look after the house.

11:01.550 --> 11:03.640
I'd be scared if I did that, too!

11:03.640 --> 11:05.480
Hina is different from you.

11:05.480 --> 11:07.890
She isn't scared of ghosts or monsters.

11:07.890 --> 11:10.770
I'm not scared of those things, either!

11:12.860 --> 11:14.190
What's that?

11:14.690 --> 11:16.320
Has it appeared?!

11:16.320 --> 11:18.530
Don't say weird things like that!

11:18.530 --> 11:20.070
But...

11:22.070 --> 11:23.740
I'll go take a look.

11:23.740 --> 11:25.280
Everyone, wait here.

11:25.280 --> 11:27.290
Please be careful.

11:38.920 --> 11:39.840
What?

11:39.840 --> 11:42.130
It's just a piece of cloth...

11:42.550 --> 11:43.970
Panties?!

11:43.970 --> 11:45.180
Hinata-chan's...

11:45.180 --> 11:46.760
Why?!

11:51.560 --> 11:52.980
This is...

11:52.980 --> 11:54.940
Hinata-chan's panti-

11:54.940 --> 11:56.690
What was it?

11:57.520 --> 11:58.730
It was nothing!

11:58.730 --> 12:00.650
It was just a piece of cloth.

12:01.650 --> 12:03.110
Let's go.

12:03.490 --> 12:06.330
I need to somehow return it to her afterwards.

12:12.080 --> 12:16.790
I'm saying, Hinata, in your case, the ball won't reach the hoop if you just use your hands.

12:16.790 --> 12:19.460
You're supposed to use your knees more.

12:19.460 --> 12:20.550
Bu~

12:20.550 --> 12:22.880
Takenaka, what you're saying is so hard.

12:22.880 --> 12:23.930
Why do I use my knees?

12:23.930 --> 12:25.720
Aren't I supposed to use my hands?

12:25.720 --> 12:28.640
Of course, I don't mean using your knees to <i>shoot</i>...

12:29.390 --> 12:31.480
How should I say this...

12:33.980 --> 12:34.810
Oh~!

12:34.810 --> 12:36.100
It reached!

12:36.100 --> 12:38.570
When I bent my knees, it went really far!

12:38.570 --> 12:39.230
Yeah!

12:39.230 --> 12:40.440
That's the way you do it!

12:40.440 --> 12:42.610
Remember that feeling, and let's try one more time.

12:41.400 --> 12:43.110
This is really surprising.

12:42.610 --> 12:43.780
Oh~!

12:52.960 --> 12:54.040
Oh~

12:54.040 --> 12:56.080
My hands feel trembly.

12:56.080 --> 12:57.250
You're tired.

12:57.250 --> 12:58.540
Let's take a break.

12:58.540 --> 12:59.840
Oh~!

13:04.380 --> 13:05.260
Oh?

13:06.800 --> 13:08.220
You're sweating a lot.

13:08.220 --> 13:09.430
Wipe it away.

13:09.430 --> 13:10.600
It's fine.

13:10.600 --> 13:12.560
I brought my handkerchief.

13:12.560 --> 13:13.560
Huh?

13:13.560 --> 13:14.430
It's gone.

13:14.430 --> 13:15.940
I think I dropped it.

13:15.940 --> 13:16.940
I see.

13:16.940 --> 13:19.360
She mistook this for a handkerchief...

13:19.860 --> 13:21.730
I'll help you find it tomorrow.

13:21.730 --> 13:23.490
Oh~, really?

13:22.730 --> 13:25.200
Geez, making us worry about them...

13:23.490 --> 13:24.780
Yay~!

13:25.200 --> 13:26.410
Wait up, Maho!

13:26.410 --> 13:28.030
Takenaka, let's do it.

13:28.740 --> 13:30.200
You should rest some more.

13:30.200 --> 13:31.240
Oh~!

13:31.240 --> 13:34.580
If Hina is the only one who isn't good,
everyone can't have fun playing basketball.

13:34.580 --> 13:36.750
That's why I'm having secret training.

13:38.540 --> 13:40.750
Let her keep going for a little longer.

13:41.880 --> 13:42.920
Yup.

13:44.260 --> 13:45.170
That's right.

13:45.170 --> 13:46.680
Bend your knees and shoot!

13:46.680 --> 13:47.930
Oh~!

13:51.510 --> 13:52.930
Bathroom

13:57.140 --> 13:57.980
That's it!

13:57.980 --> 13:58.770
Nice shot!

13:58.770 --> 13:59.730
Oh~!

13:59.730 --> 14:01.770
Takenaka-style training shot.

14:06.280 --> 14:07.530
What's that?

14:11.410 --> 14:14.330
Hakamada
Hinata

14:11.410 --> 14:13.200
This is...

14:14.330 --> 14:16.160
I had a good soak today.

14:26.720 --> 14:28.260
Wake up, Takenaka.

14:30.680 --> 14:32.390
What is it?

14:33.060 --> 14:33.930
Are you awake?

14:33.930 --> 14:34.680
Okay.

14:34.680 --> 14:36.100
We're going to return it.

14:36.100 --> 14:37.640
Hinata-chan's panties.

14:38.190 --> 14:38.850
Ah...

14:38.850 --> 14:39.770
Panties...

14:39.770 --> 14:41.190
Got it...

14:41.190 --> 14:41.980
Hey!

14:41.980 --> 14:43.070
Why do you know-

14:43.980 --> 14:45.320
Don't argue. Let's go.

14:45.320 --> 14:47.860
With this, we will be saved.

14:50.820 --> 14:53.120
I left that there.

14:53.120 --> 14:56.410
I was hoping for a girl to find it.

14:56.410 --> 14:58.790
You perverted, rotten, lolicon bastard!

14:58.790 --> 15:03.630
You have no right to criticise me, seeing as you hid it inside your pocket.

15:03.630 --> 15:04.920
That's different!

15:04.920 --> 15:09.090
You suddenly appeared, and I didn't want to create any weird misunderstandings.

15:09.130 --> 15:15.470
Tomoka talked to me where I picked it up, and without thinking... I hid it.

15:15.470 --> 15:16.890
Do you think I would believe you?!

15:16.890 --> 15:20.560
Anyway, we have to repent for our sins together.

15:20.560 --> 15:26.190
In fact, it was because you brought it back to our room that we have to sneak into <i>their</i> room to return it.

15:28.900 --> 15:29.780
All right.

15:29.780 --> 15:31.280
Everyone seems to be sleeping.

15:31.280 --> 15:32.030
Let's go.

15:32.030 --> 15:33.950
Damn, this sucks.

15:38.330 --> 15:40.660
Their bags should be inside this cupboard.

15:42.500 --> 15:44.000
Carefully...

15:44.000 --> 15:45.210
Understood.

15:47.960 --> 15:49.920
Hinata-chan's bag...

15:50.510 --> 15:51.550
This is it!

15:53.300 --> 15:54.590
Subarun!

15:58.100 --> 15:59.100
Sleep-talking, huh...

15:59.100 --> 15:59.890
The futons!

16:01.850 --> 16:02.770
What?!

16:02.770 --> 16:03.730
This is bad!

16:03.730 --> 16:04.230
My glasses.

16:04.230 --> 16:04.860
Where are my glasses?

16:05.150 --> 16:05.810
Damn you!

16:05.810 --> 16:06.730
You traitor!

16:08.190 --> 16:10.940
Seems like the futons fell out of the cupboard.

16:10.940 --> 16:12.070
What, that was it?

16:10.940 --> 16:12.320
This is bad...

16:12.070 --> 16:13.200
I was so shocked.

16:12.320 --> 16:14.320
I've got to hide somewhere.

16:13.200 --> 16:15.120
Did we leave the cupboard open?

16:15.120 --> 16:17.490
Maho, didn't you sleep-talk just then?

16:17.490 --> 16:19.240
Maybe that's why the futons fell out?

16:20.370 --> 16:22.370
How could that be possible?

16:22.870 --> 16:26.290
Hina... It's amazing that she can still sleep at a time like this.

16:26.290 --> 16:27.880
Are you all right, Tomo?

16:27.880 --> 16:29.300
Yeah...

16:29.300 --> 16:31.380
Airi, do you want me to help you?

16:31.380 --> 16:33.430
It's okay; I'll finish soon.

16:33.430 --> 16:34.130
Thanks anyway.

16:34.130 --> 16:35.010
Sorry.

16:35.010 --> 16:37.140
Okay, let's go back to sleep.

16:45.440 --> 16:47.150
Now's your chance.

16:47.150 --> 16:48.650
Sorry.

16:48.650 --> 16:50.400
Thanks a lot, Tomoka.

17:03.660 --> 17:04.540
Um...

17:04.540 --> 17:05.710
Subaru-san.

17:09.290 --> 17:10.420
That was...

17:10.420 --> 17:13.340
I left my basketball equipment there.

17:13.340 --> 17:16.220
I would've felt bad if I'd woken you all up just for that, so I was going to quietly take it and go.

17:16.220 --> 17:18.430
So that was what happened.

17:18.430 --> 17:21.810
I was panicking too, so I'm really sorry.

17:21.810 --> 17:24.100
Then, do you want me to get it for you?

17:24.100 --> 17:25.690
Ah, it's fine!

17:25.690 --> 17:28.810
Now that I think about it, I don't need it right now.

17:32.480 --> 17:33.990
I understand.

17:33.990 --> 17:35.860
Good night.

17:36.360 --> 17:38.780
Yeah, good night.

17:43.790 --> 17:45.540
I'm back.

17:45.540 --> 17:47.330
You're still not sleeping?

17:47.330 --> 17:49.250
Do you think I could still sleep after something like that?

17:49.250 --> 17:52.420
Well, in any case, the training camp is over.

17:52.420 --> 17:55.800
All that's left is for you guys to bring back results in the tournament.

17:55.800 --> 17:59.590
Well, about the tournament...

17:59.590 --> 18:01.550
You can't substitute anyone, right?

18:01.550 --> 18:02.350
Huh?

18:02.350 --> 18:06.140
Apart from injuries, you can't
substitute anyone during the game!

18:06.140 --> 18:07.890
Didn't you know that?!

18:08.850 --> 18:12.650
Well, I was just told about the training camp, and no one told me any specific details...

18:12.650 --> 18:14.150
I see...

18:14.150 --> 18:17.400
Then stamina is going to be an important factor.

18:18.200 --> 18:20.870
Hey, promise me.

18:20.870 --> 18:22.580
Don't drop Hinata from the team.

18:22.580 --> 18:23.620
Takenaka.

18:24.410 --> 18:25.870
She's working really hard!

18:25.870 --> 18:29.710
Though she's still not great, I want you to give her a chance!

18:32.250 --> 18:34.710
Everyone else is working hard, too.

18:34.710 --> 18:36.420
I don't want to drop anyone.

18:36.420 --> 18:39.130
But basketball is played in teams of five.

18:40.430 --> 18:41.640
Yeah...

18:42.510 --> 18:44.930
What do you mean, Natsuhi?

18:44.930 --> 18:46.930
There's nothing behind it.

18:46.930 --> 18:49.640
You'll play in the tournament by yourselves.

18:49.640 --> 18:54.070
Is it because you don't want to play basketball with us?

18:54.070 --> 18:55.940
It's not that.

18:55.940 --> 18:56.690
But...

18:56.690 --> 18:57.650
But?

18:57.650 --> 19:00.570
I think I can leave it to you guys this time.

19:00.570 --> 19:02.070
To the five of you.

19:02.070 --> 19:03.410
Takenaka-kun...

19:03.910 --> 19:07.580
It's a good chance for me to see the boys'
basketball club in action from the sidelines, too.

19:07.580 --> 19:09.870
Do your best as the girls' basketball club.

19:09.870 --> 19:11.250
So that's how you're going to do it.

19:11.250 --> 19:13.630
Subarun, say something!

19:13.630 --> 19:16.500
If Natsuhi doesn't play, the tournament will be...

19:16.500 --> 19:21.630
He's not taking part because he feels you girls can win on your own, right?

19:21.630 --> 19:24.350
Is that true, Natsuhi?

19:24.350 --> 19:29.020
Although, if you feel you can't win, I could change my mind.

19:29.020 --> 19:30.520
What was that-

19:30.520 --> 19:31.810
Saki.

19:32.900 --> 19:35.820
If you say that, we won't back down either.

19:35.820 --> 19:38.360
Let's show him that we can win by ourselves!

19:38.360 --> 19:40.070
That's right.

19:40.070 --> 19:40.950
Yup!

19:40.950 --> 19:41.700
Got it!

19:41.700 --> 19:43.030
Let's do this!

19:43.030 --> 19:43.870
Oh~!

19:43.030 --> 19:44.120
What is it?

19:43.870 --> 19:45.580
Let's do it~

19:44.120 --> 19:45.580
It's nothing.

19:46.280 --> 19:49.250
I'm an outsider now, so I'll be counting on you to be the coach.

19:49.250 --> 19:50.040
What?!

19:50.040 --> 19:52.330
Do your best, Coach Takenaka!

20:01.170 --> 20:02.880
Turn, turn!

20:02.880 --> 20:04.090
Miho-nee...

20:04.090 --> 20:06.050
Normally, this would be considered a crime.

20:06.850 --> 20:08.430
Are you serious?!

20:08.430 --> 20:11.270
Look, if you don't hurry, everyone's going to be here.

20:11.270 --> 20:13.190
And actually, if I were found out, I'd be in big trouble!

20:13.190 --> 20:15.480
You said you wanted to watch the match, right?

20:15.480 --> 20:17.400
I did say that, but...

20:17.940 --> 20:18.980
Maho!

20:19.730 --> 20:20.860
Mo-kan!

20:21.650 --> 20:22.530
Saki!

20:22.530 --> 20:23.280
Hina!

20:23.910 --> 20:24.820
Do it!

20:24.820 --> 20:26.030
Oh~!

20:26.030 --> 20:28.240
Takenaka-style special training!

20:33.500 --> 20:34.540
We did it!

20:34.540 --> 20:37.250
We won!

20:38.710 --> 20:39.800
We did it!

20:40.510 --> 20:42.420
Hina worked really hard.

20:41.050 --> 20:42.420
All of us worked hard.

20:43.800 --> 20:46.010
I want to celebrate with everyone, too!

20:47.350 --> 20:51.100
Who in the world left a vaulting box here?

20:55.150 --> 20:56.940
Wait...!

20:56.940 --> 20:59.070
It's heavier than I thought.

21:02.820 --> 21:04.110
What should I do now?

21:04.110 --> 21:06.030
I'll call Miho-nee-

21:06.610 --> 21:09.700
We've become regular customers here, right?

21:09.700 --> 21:12.450
It stinks of mould, but all five of us can change here.

21:11.040 --> 21:12.620
I'm saved!

21:12.450 --> 21:16.120
I would have liked to show Subaru-san our win.

21:12.620 --> 21:14.460
With this I can get out of here.

21:19.880 --> 21:21.460
Ah, Hina-chan!

21:21.460 --> 21:23.260
That's the first time I've seen that pair of panties.

21:23.260 --> 21:24.420
Oh~!

21:24.420 --> 21:28.220
I lost a pair during the training camp, so I bought another one.

21:28.220 --> 21:29.180
You lost a pair?

21:29.180 --> 21:30.970
Could it possibly have been stolen?

21:30.970 --> 21:32.140
By Subarun?

21:32.140 --> 21:33.310
It could have been Natsuhi.

21:33.310 --> 21:35.480
Neither of them would do something like that.

21:35.480 --> 21:36.350
Huh?

21:36.350 --> 21:38.440
My usual bra isn't here.

21:38.440 --> 21:39.650
Ah, it's there.

21:39.650 --> 21:41.860
There's something white poking out from inside the vaulting box.

21:43.320 --> 21:44.530
Saki-chan, is this it?

21:44.530 --> 21:46.570
No, it's over to the right.

22:00.790 --> 22:03.340
I want to grow up quickly (Yes-!)

22:13.060 --> 22:14.390
Come on! Come on!

22:14.390 --> 22:17.140
If I'm small, if I stay small

22:17.140 --> 22:19.650
You say there's virtue in it.

22:19.650 --> 22:21.230
But that's a lie!

22:21.230 --> 22:22.320
You're just trying to console me, right?

22:22.610 --> 22:24.940
I want to grow up faster!

22:25.360 --> 22:28.030
Drink milk, drink soy milk

22:28.030 --> 22:30.740
You say that the shrimp there is good.

22:30.740 --> 22:32.120
Triple A

22:32.120 --> 22:33.990
I don't need any ratings

22:33.990 --> 22:36.000
I want to grow up faster!

22:36.000 --> 22:36.790
Dribble!

22:36.790 --> 22:37.460
Zig-zag

22:37.460 --> 22:38.120
Defence!

22:38.120 --> 22:39.000
Offence (Yep!)

22:39.000 --> 22:41.080
I want to shoot the ball

22:41.830 --> 22:49.130
I want to be praised soon... by you

22:49.680 --> 22:52.180
"Look here. Look here. It's going to end!"

22:52.180 --> 22:54.850
Jump shite! Jump shite!

22:52.180 --> 22:54.850
Jump! Jump!

22:55.140 --> 22:57.350
More and more and more

22:58.230 --> 23:03.060
When can I become an adult

23:03.060 --> 23:08.860
I'm growing! It's painful! The painful sores.

23:09.150 --> 23:13.660
However, I'll definitely show you that I can endure it

23:13.660 --> 23:20.870
Shake, Bounce, Touch, Aim for the goal!

23:21.250 --> 23:24.340
Ah! I want to grow up faster!

23:25.210 --> 23:26.340
Okonomiyaki.

23:26.340 --> 23:28.880
It was made by Sennorikyuu at a tea gathering,

23:28.880 --> 23:30.880
and it was said to be the beginning of funoyaki.

23:28.880 --> 23:30.880
TL Note: Funoyaki is an old Japanese food that resembles plain okonomiyaki and is said to be the original okonomiyaki.

23:30.880 --> 23:32.720
There are Kansai and Hiroshima styles,

23:32.720 --> 23:34.600
and there are many differences between the culture of these two styles.

23:34.600 --> 23:40.020
While the Kansai style mixes the dough, Hiroshima style piles it up without mixing-

23:36.970 --> 23:40.020
Next Time:

23:36.970 --> 23:40.020
In Love With Your Bud
